==============================================================================================================
WHAT THIS MATRIX DOES NOT MEASURE
==============================================================================================================

  It does not measure whether a sphere is INTERESTING. A page can score 100 by
  computing something true and dull.

  It does not measure whether a LIT claim is WORTH making -- only whether the page
  reproduces the number it printed.

  It does not check World I at all. Those 2,048 pages are elsewhere.

  A sphere with no LIT numbers scores 0 on that axis. Some of those are honest --
  they make a qualitative point. The score cannot tell those from an empty one.

  UNMEASURED is a statement about this harness, not about those 45 pages.

